OL,3,GNEWSACalf's 'lucky escape' after
OL,4,Afireworks spook herd
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vet says a 12-hour-old calf had a
OL,7,F"lucky escape" after suffering a broken
OL,8,Fleg when it was trampled by other
OL,9,Fcattle in a herd spooked by bonfire
OL,10,Fnight fireworks.
OL,12,FMolly McKay, a veterinary surgeon at
OL,13,FNorfolk Farm Ltd, was called out to a
OL,14,Ffarm near Skegness on Thursday evening
OL,15,Fto treat the calf, named Neil.
OL,17,FMcKay fitted the injured leg with a
OL,18,Fplaster cast and said Neil was already
OL,19,Fback on his feet.
OL,23,APub: 06-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,386,380,200,160,0,100
